featured-scp4975.jpg: iwantcheckmate.com's own lobby thumbnail for the SCP-4975 challenge,
  https://iwantcheckmate.com/challenge-thumbnails/crack.png (1280x720, fetched 2026-11-26, JPEG q84, no other edits).
  Used only by the lobby's featured-mode hero (js/lobby/hype.js FEATURED.art). Kept out of assets/modes/icm-scp4975/
  on purpose: that folder belongs to the mode (fin2-horror owns it). If that mode gets a real video, switch FEATURED.art
  to the video's maxresdefault thumbnail.
featured-HuZlhHnES7M.jpg / featured-HuZlhHnES7M-640.jpg (2026-11-26): the SCP-4975 video's own YouTube thumbnail,
  https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HuZlhHnES7M/maxresdefault.jpg (1280x720; copy in research/ref/fin2-scp4975/), re-saved JPEG q86,
  640 px version LANCZOS-downscaled. Now the featured hero art (js/lobby/hype.js FEATURED.art / artSmall), since the
  mode got its video. featured-scp4975.jpg (the site's challenge art) is no longer referenced.

featured-HuZlhHnES7M-f1/-f2(.jpg, -640.jpg): frames from the SCP-4975 video (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HuZlhHnES7M), YouTube auto-thumbnails https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HuZlhHnES7M/maxres1.jpg and maxres2.jpg (1280x720), re-encoded q76; used by the s5-ui featured banner montage (js/lobby/hype.js). (c) iwantcheckmate, fan use like the other video stills.

featured-agJbUnr6PCQ.jpg / -640.jpg (2026-11-27): the SCP-956 video's own YouTube thumbnail,
  https://i.ytimg.com/vi/agJbUnr6PCQ/maxresdefault.jpg (1280x720; copy in research/ref/agJbUnr6PCQ/), re-saved JPEG q86,
  640 px LANCZOS. featured-agJbUnr6PCQ-f1/-f2(.jpg, -640.jpg): YouTube auto-thumbnails maxres1.jpg (the 3x3 pinata
  card) and maxres2.jpg (a gameplay still with the revealed pinata on b6), q76. FEATURED hero since 2026-11-27 (the
  SCP-4975 files stay; they are no longer the hero). (c) iwantcheckmate, fan use like the other video stills.
